      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "89 Shingán, Milehouse Road, Enniscorthy, Co. Wexford\n\nKavanagh Estates are delighted to bring No. 89 Shingán, Milehouse Road, Enniscorthy to the market. This well-maintained two-bedroom terraced home offers bright and spacious accommodation throughout and is ideally suited to first-time buyers, downsizers or investors.\n\nLocated in a popular residential development on the outskirts of Enniscorthy, the property is within easy reach of the town centre and its wide range of shops, schools, services and amenities.\n\nThe accommodation comprises entrance hall, bright living room with open fire, kitchen/diner and downstairs WC. Upstairs are two well-proportioned bedrooms, with the very generous master bedroom benefiting from an en-suite, together with a main family bathroom.\n\nThe property benefits from oil-fired central heating and also features a good-sized, fully enclosed rear garden, providing a private and attractive outdoor space.\n\nNo. 89 Shingán represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-maintained and spacious home in a convenient and established residential location."
      },
